<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bg">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <title>myPOS (локален симулатор)</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif; background: #0b2230; color: #12303f;
             display: grid; place-items: center; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; }
      .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 30px 32px; width: 100%; max-width: 400px;
              box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
      .tag { display: inline-block; background: #fef3c7; color: #92600a; font-weight: 700; font-size: .72rem;
             padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 12px 0 4px; }
      p.sub { color: #64798a; margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: .9rem; }
      .amount { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0b2230; margin: 10px 0 4px; }
      .row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2e9ef; font-size: .92rem; }
      .row span:first-child { color: #64798a; }
      .actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; }
      .actions form { flex: 1; margin: 0; }
      button { width: 100%; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; padding: 13px; border-radius: 10px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; }
      .pay { background: #22a3a4; color: #fff; }
      .cancel { background: #eef3f6; color: #12303f; }
      .note { margin-top: 16px; color: #94a3b8; font-size: .78rem; text-align: center; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="tag">Локален симулатор</span>
      <h1>myPOS плащане</h1>
      <p class="sub">Това е тестова страница вместо myPOS. Реални карти не се таксуват.</p>

      <div class="amount"><%= @params["Amount"] %> <%= @params["Currency"] %></div>
      <div class="row"><span>Поръчка</span><span>#<%= @params["OrderID"] %></span></div>
      <div class="row"><span>Магазин (SID)</span><span><%= @params["SID"] %></span></div>

      <% forward = %w[URL_OK URL_Cancel URL_Notify SID WalletNumber KeyIndex OrderID Amount Currency] %>

      <div class="actions">
        <%= form_tag "/dev/mypos/pay", method: :post, authenticity_token: false do %>
          <% forward.each { |k| %><%= hidden_field_tag k, @params[k], id: nil %><% } %>
          <button type="submit" class="pay">Плати (успех)</button>
        <% end %>
        <%= form_tag "/dev/mypos/cancel", method: :post, authenticity_token: false do %>
          <%= hidden_field_tag "URL_Cancel", @params["URL_Cancel"], id: nil %>
          <button type="submit" class="cancel">Откажи</button>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <p class="note">„Плати“ ще изпрати подписано известие към магазина и ще потвърди поръчката.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
